{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How far will you go to keep your crown?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pitchforks and Daggers is a <strong>branching court politics drama</strong> where every choice matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As King Henry of Elander, you must navigate treacherous lords, scheming family members, and angry peasants- all while trying to secure your kingdom\u2019s future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game of difficult decisions. <strong>Every action has consequences</strong>, shaping the fate of your rule and the land you govern. Consult your court, weigh your options, and decide carefully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Make difficult decisions:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2762740/extras/2226cc9f5d0799cbc30e1957a31a0ad1.poster.avif?t=1757269713\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2762740/extras/2226cc9f5d0799cbc30e1957a31a0ad1.webm?t=1757269713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2762740/extras/2226cc9f5d0799cbc30e1957a31a0ad1.mp4?t=1757269713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deeply <strong>branching narrative</strong> with multiple endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A web of political intrigue, betrayal, and war.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-stakes choices that <strong>impact the story</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayability</strong>- see the different paths your rule could take.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Be prepared to fail:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2762740/extras/590318251eaf515cf294c4231e9245ba.poster.avif?t=1757269713\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2762740/extras/590318251eaf515cf294c4231e9245ba.webm?t=1757269713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2762740/extras/590318251eaf515cf294c4231e9245ba.mp4?t=1757269713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Story:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >King Henry has no heir, his beloved wife cannot bear children. Meanwhile, his uncle, King Harold of Ervin, challenges his claim to the throne.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The kingdom teeters on the brink of war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices will shape the fate of Elander. Will you secure your legacy, or lose everything?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Defend Elander:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2762740/extras/e5549d616e74e00d91469e0a1c5ff602.poster.avif?t=1757269713\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2762740/extras/e5549d616e74e00d91469e0a1c5ff602.webm?t=1757269713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2762740/extras/e5549d616e74e00d91469e0a1c5ff602.mp4?t=1757269713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://